      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**§27–§28 SOC (arch_plan/10):** low-cardinality counters only. Slice by `channel` / `reason` / `path_class` — no raw paths or tenant UUIDs in labels. Alerts: `SpamBlockedTotalElevated`, `SecurityAuthFailureBurst`, `SecuritySuspiciousRequestBurst` in `deploy/prometheus/dental_booking_alerts.yml`. Runbook: `docs/architecture/arch_plan/10_CROSS_CUTTING_SECURITY_ANTISPAM_BRAND_SCALE.md`."
      },
      "title": "Notes",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (channel) (rate(spam_blocked_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{channel}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "HTTP 429 — spam_blocked_total rate by channel",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(security_auth_failure_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "401/403 — security_auth_failure_total rate by reason",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
